; This export set intentionally differs from dlls/mscordbi/mscordbi_unixexports.src:
; the HMODULE-taking OpenVirtualProcessImpl is not exported here. Because this binary
; owns its own PAL, an HMODULE handed in by a caller is not a valid module in this PAL,
; so only the path-based OpenVirtualProcessImpl2 activation flow is supported.

; COM-instantiation
DllGetClassObjectInternal
DllGetClassObject

; CoreClr API
CoreCLRCreateCordbObject
CoreCLRCreateCordbObjectEx
CoreCLRCreateCordbObject3

; Out-of-proc creation path from the shim - ICLRDebugging
OpenVirtualProcessImpl2

; DllMain is exported for the Unix PAL loader to discover via dlsym; DbgDllMain calls
; PAL_InitializeDLL itself, so the private PAL still initializes. PAL_RegisterModule and
; PAL_UnregisterModule are intentionally not exported: the loader treats registration as
; optional, and the path-based ABI never hands a cross-PAL module handle to this binary.
DllMain
